  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div id=\"bbc-main\"><article><div data-component=\"headline-block\"><p><h2>Olivier Awards red carpet: Stars arrive for theatre's biggest night</h2></p></div><div data-testid=\"byline\" data-component=\"byline-block\"><p><time datetime=\"2026-04-12T17:10:51.460Z\">1 hour ago</time></p><p><span data-testid=\"byline-contributors\"><div data-testid=\"byline-contributors-contributor-0\"><p><span>Steven McIntosh</span><span data-testid=\"byline-contributors-contributor-0-role-location\">Entertainment reporter</span></p></div></span></p></div><div data-component=\"image-block\"></div><div data-component=\"text-block\"><p><b id=\"cate-blanchett,-rachel-zegler,-and-paddington-bear-were-among-the-stars-walking-the-red-carpet-at-this-year's-olivier-awards,-which-celebrate-the-best-of-british-theatre.\">Cate Blanchett, Rachel Zegler, and Paddington Bear were among the stars walking the red carpet at this year's Olivier Awards, which celebrate the best of British theatre.</b></p></div><div data-component=\"text-block\"><p>Bryan Cranston, Rosamund Pike and Tom Hiddleston also posed for pictures at London's Royal Albert Hall ahead of the ceremony, which is being hosted by Ted Lasso star Nick Mohammed.</p></div><div data-component=\"text-block\"><p>(However, we still refer to it as a \"red carpet\" for the purposes of search traffic, which we hope you'll forgive.)</p></div><div data-component=\"text-block\"><p>Here are some of the stage stars attending Sunday's event.</p></div><div data-component=\"image-block\"></div><div data-component=\"image-block\"></div><div data-component=\"image-block\"></div><div data-component=\"image-block\"></div><div data-component=\"image-block\"></div><div data-component=\"image-block\"></div><div data-component=\"image-block\"></div><div data-component=\"image-block\"></div><div data-component=\"image-block\"></div><div data-component=\"image-block\"></div><div data-component=\"image-block